---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const repositoryUrl = 'https://github.com/phildaniels/argentum';
const terminalUrl = '/argentum-terminal/index.html';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Try Argentum"
	description="Run Argentum's interactive browser-terminal market dashboard."
	sideBarActiveItemID="projects"
>
	<header class="reveal mb-8">
		<a
			class="mb-5 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline"
			href="/projects/"
		>
			← Back to projects
		</a>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="eyebrow">Interactive demo</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-6xl">Argentum</h1>
				<p class="section-copy mt-5 text-lg">
					A glanceable market dashboard built for the terminal. Press Enter below to launch the real
					static browser build, then use the displayed keyboard and mouse controls.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap gap-2">
				<a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href={terminalUrl} target="_blank">
					Open full screen ↗
				</a>
				<a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href={repositoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
					View source ↗
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section class="reveal reveal-delay-1" aria-labelledby="browser-terminal-heading">
		<h2 id="browser-terminal-heading" class="sr-only">
			Argentum browser terminal
		</h2>
		<div class="mobile-terminal surface-card p-6 sm:hidden">
			<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
				<div class="grid h-12 w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-secondary/30 bg-secondary/10 font-mono font-bold text-secondary">
					Ag
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow">Mobile experience</p>
					<h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Run Argentum full screen</h2>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-base-content/68">
				The real TUI works on mobile, but it is most usable outside the portfolio chrome. Launch it
				full screen, rotate to landscape when possible, then press Enter to start the dashboard.
			</p>
			<ol class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/65">
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="font-mono font-bold text-primary">01</span>
					<span>Open the terminal in its own tab.</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="font-mono font-bold text-primary">02</span>
					<span>Use landscape orientation for more chart columns.</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="font-mono font-bold text-primary">03</span>
					<span>Tap the terminal and use the displayed keyboard controls.</span>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<a class="btn btn-primary mt-6 w-full" href={terminalUrl} target="_blank">
				Launch full-screen terminal ↗
			</a>

			<details class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/45">
				<summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">Run inline instead</summary>
				<div class="mobile-inline-terminal border-t border-base-content/10">
					<iframe
						src={terminalUrl}
						title="Interactive Argentum mobile browser terminal"
						loading="lazy"
						allow="clipboard-write"
					></iframe>
				</div>
			</details>
		</div>

		<div class="terminal-embed surface-card hidden overflow-hidden sm:block">
			<iframe
				src={terminalUrl}
				title="Interactive Argentum browser terminal"
				loading="eager"
				allow="clipboard-write"
			></iframe>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/60">
			This self-contained build runs the dashboard in an event-driven Web Worker and renders it
			through xterm.js. Browser market data comes from TradingView’s keyless, CORS-enabled scanner;
			unauthenticated US equity prices may be delayed.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.terminal-embed {
		background: #21222c;
		height: clamp(38rem, 74vh, 54rem);
	}

	.terminal-embed iframe {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}

	.mobile-inline-terminal {
		height: min(38rem, 72dvh);
		background: #21222c;
	}

	.mobile-inline-terminal iframe {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}
</style>
